cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "XLS-R codebook experiments: equivalence-bounded tests of the acoustic codebook on Sinhala and Tamil"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered experiments testing whether the frozen product-quantizer codebook of
  XLS-R 0.3B and XLSR-53 under-represents Sinhala and Tamil: masked-position codebook fit
  with positive controls, an 18-language family-matched equivalence test of pre-training
  membership, layer-wise linear probing, and post-hoc code-overlap, synthetic
  codebook-deficit and fine-tuning analyses.
